{"id":"wb-5-274","name":"柏山东岳庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"柏山东岳庙","text":"柏山东岳庙位于中国山西省临汾市蒲县城东的柏山，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n柏山东岳庙始建年代不详，早在唐代即初具规模，元大德七年（1303年）因平阳地震被毁，延祐三年至五年（1316～1318年）重修。庙坐北朝南，占地2万平方米，由东岳行宫、地狱、华清池、太蔚庙五部分组成。现存建筑中只有行宫大殿为元代建筑，其它均为明清所建。大殿面阔进深均五间，重檐歇山顶。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%8F%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%9C%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99","revisionId":92021359,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92021359","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2373bf43918008e12fbdbcf5.jpg","title":"柏山东岳庙国保.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%9F%8F%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%9C%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/%E6%9F%8F%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%9C%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​柏山东岳庙国家重点文保单位立碑。","width":320,"height":182}}